{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfWYt7M1h6bkZjXBGKbi1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AfnQBXgyjyiLNqMnfgmFjj","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"interpretation":"The prior judgment (47f52a37) chose Testing, and it ran as C2 measurement cdf77337 against the corrected CLI from construction a55f6c05. Every selected file in that run is current, and it has no stale dependencies.\n\n- **Command 0** (`node generated/hello-world.mjs`) exited 0. It printed exactly `Hello, world!\\n` (14 bytes) with empty stderr.\n- **Command 1** (`node --test test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs`) exited 0. It reported tests 2, pass 2, fail 0, with empty stderr.\n\nThe run used the declared empty env and cwd `.`.\n\nThis gives the behavior obligation its realization and verifier-execution evidence on the current subject. It also completes the revision chain:\n1. Baseline 8499dedb: original bytes, command 1 exited nonzero with 0 passes and 2 failures. This stays historical, and its stale dependency is correctly recorded.\n2. Construction a55f6c05: a one-line correction.\n3. Current measurement cdf77337: the correction resolves that failure.\n\nNeither obligation is closed yet, because both still need an independent semantic assessment.\n\nThe four authored assets are still absent in worksite 54c18bf3:\n- `specification/project-conformance.md`\n- `design/implementation-design.md`\n- `design/test-design.md`\n- `test-execution-plan.json`\n\nSo the conformance, implementation-design, test-design and execution-plan obligations, plus complete-original, have no realization.\n\nThe steel thread from CLI to verifiers is now established. The remaining work is authoring the assets and then UAT. The asset files are outside Testing's selected paths, so writing them does not make cdf77337 stale. A further measurement is needed only if the CLI or supplied tests change.\n\nThe original stage plan's handwritten `test-execution-result.json` is not required. The witness contract replaces that receipt with admitted C2 evidence, and no write root allows it.","contributions":[{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/specification@5","contribution":"Write only `specification/project-conformance.md`, with four parts:\n- **Intent:** a minimal CLI Hello World software-build traversal.\n- **Product boundary:** the source surface is `generated/hello-world.mjs`. It runs under Node without package installation and has no network dependency. The supplied component and UAT tests are the verification surfaces.\n- **Source-grounded requirements:** running the CLI with no arguments writes exactly `Hello, world!\\n` to stdout and exits 0.\n- **Completion criteria:** the execution proof runs the CLI and observes that exact stdout. Both tests spawn the real CLI, and `node --test test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs` gives at least 2 passes and 0 failures. Truthful execution-result meaning comes from admitted command evidence, not a prewritten report.\n\nDo not write source, tests, package files or execution plans.","reason":"The conformance asset is absent and must be written fresh by native work. It is the authority the design assets must follow. Current measurement cdf77337 settles the CLI contract it will state, so no further uncertainty blocks it.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/conformance@5","obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/54c18bf3e9bd4c8fa724b9a1a5a82d13185c9d1972e91fb0089bb5bf2829fc8f","result://abiogenesis/cdf773374207b01f6e61bf55c0257fbda4ed1b063582c03e7405b148595f11f9"],"dependsOn":[]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/design@5","contribution":"Write three files, using the new conformance asset as authority:\n- **`design/implementation-design.md`:** a minimal Node CLI at `generated/hello-world.mjs` that prints exactly `Hello, world!` plus one newline, using only built-ins. Name the component and UAT test surfaces, `test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs` and `test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs`, which execute the CLI and assert stdout.\n- **`design/test-design.md`:** component and UAT validation of the stdout contract. Both tests spawn `process.execPath` with [\"generated/hello-world.mjs\"] from the project root using `node:test`, `node:assert/strict` and `spawnSync`, and assert status 0 and stdout exactly `Hello, world!\\n`.\n- **`test-execution-plan.json`:** command `node`; args [\"--test\",\"test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs\",\"test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs\"]; expectedTestPassCount of at least 2; expectedStdoutMatch containing stable zero-failure evidence such as `fail 0`, without pinning an exact pass count; assertedReturnValue `Hello, world!`.\n\nThe plan must agree with the two fixed commands but does not control execution. Do not write `test-execution-result.json`.","reason":"All three design assets are absent. They must match the original source and the conformance asset once it exists. The actual verifier behavior supports naming the supplied tests as adequate surfaces: they caught the baseline mismatch in 8499dedb and passed on the corrected CLI in cdf77337.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/implementation-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/test-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/execution-plan@5","obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/54c18bf3e9bd4c8fa724b9a1a5a82d13185c9d1972e91fb0089bb5bf2829fc8f","result://abiogenesis/8499dedb271fa5f327e541beb500066e320ee0442cd0d8116a068bbb5620ce9f","result://abiogenesis/cdf773374207b01f6e61bf55c0257fbda4ed1b063582c03e7405b148595f11f9"],"dependsOn":["graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/specification@5"]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/uat@5","contribution":"A read-only, independent assessment of the full original outcome against the oracle rubric. It covers:\n- the exact current CLI bytes;\n- the content of the four authored assets and how they correspond to the original source and to each other;\n- whether the supplied verifiers are adequate, meaning they execute the real CLI and assert status and exact stdout;\n- whether the execution plan matches the fixed commands and original expectations;\n- current C2 measurement cdf77337: exact stdout, exit 0, 2 passes, 0 failures, with the declared env and cwd;\n- the consequential revision: baseline failure 8499dedb stays historical, correction a55f6c05 follows from it, and cdf77337 shows the result.\n\nUnmet and indeterminate criteria are kept. The subject will be cdf77337, provided it is still current when UAT is selected.","reason":"Parent completion needs an independent semantic assessment of current evidence by an actor who is neither the author nor the measurement producer. The current measurement now exists, but the authored assets do not, so UAT cannot yet assess the complete outcome.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5","obligation://default-library-witness/conformance@5","obligation://default-library-witness/implementation-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/test-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/execution-plan@5","obligation://default-library-witness/behavior@5","obligation://default-library-witness/revision@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","result://abiogenesis/8499dedb271fa5f327e541beb500066e320ee0442cd0d8116a068bbb5620ce9f","result://abiogenesis/a55f6c05d82e61635cb5da84a86e74b336178f6015071e3bfded650abf0aa3f3","result://abiogenesis/cdf773374207b01f6e61bf55c0257fbda4ed1b063582c03e7405b148595f11f9"],"dependsOn":["graph-function://abiogenesi